Q: Use a HTML page as Live Wallpaper in Android A: <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;18 Month Progress Tracker&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@700;900&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap&quot; rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot;&gt;
    &lt;style&gt;
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --bg-primary: #0a0a0f;
            --bg-secondary: #141420;
            --accent-primary: #00d9ff;
            --accent-secondary: #ff00e5;
            --dot-empty: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --dot-filled: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d9ff 0%, #ff00e5 100%);
            --text-primary: #ffffff;
            --text-secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            --glow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.4);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Animated gradient background */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%);
            animation: breathe 8s ease-in-out infinite;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        @keyframes breathe {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        .container {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            padding: 40px 20px 60px;
            max-width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            animation: slideDown 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideDown {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .title {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-primary) 0%, var(--accent-secondary) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: var(--glow);
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 20px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.2s backwards;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .stat {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-primary), var(--accent-secondary));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .progress-bar-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.4s backwards;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-primary), var(--accent-secondary));
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: width 1s ease-out;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent-primary);
        }

        .dots-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12px, 1fr));
            gap: 8px;
            max-width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-secondary);
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.6s backwards;
        }

        .dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--dot-empty);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55);
            position: relative;
        }

        .dot.filled {
            background: var(--dot-filled);
            border-color: transparent;
            box-shadow: 
                0 0 10px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.5),
                0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.3);
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .dot.today {
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1.1);
                box-shadow: 
                    0 0 10px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.5),
                    0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.3);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.3);
                box-shadow: 
                    0 0 20px rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.8),
                    0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.5);
            }
        }

        .motivation {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 217, 255, 0.1), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.1));
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 0.8s backwards;
        }

        .motivation-text {
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .date-info {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out 1s backwards;
        }

        /* Mobile optimization */
        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .title {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }
            .dots-container {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10px, 1fr));
                gap: 6px;
            }
            .dot {
                width: 10px;
                height: 10px;
            }
        }
    &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h1 class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;548 DAYS&lt;/h1&gt;
            &lt;p class=&quot;subtitle&quot;&gt;18 MONTH JOURNEY&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;stats&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;stat-value&quot; id=&quot;daysCompleted&quot;&gt;0&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;stat-label&quot;&gt;Completed&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;stat-value&quot; id=&quot;percentComplete&quot;&gt;0%&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;stat-label&quot;&gt;Progress&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;stat&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;stat-value&quot; id=&quot;daysLeft&quot;&gt;548&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;stat-label&quot;&gt;Remaining&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;progress-bar-container&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;progress-bar&quot; id=&quot;progressBar&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;dots-container&quot; id=&quot;dotsContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;motivation&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;motivation-text&quot; id=&quot;motivationText&quot;&gt;EVERY DAY COUNTS&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;

        &lt;div class=&quot;date-info&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div&gt;Started: &lt;span id=&quot;startDate&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div&gt;Today: &lt;span id=&quot;currentDate&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div&gt;Ends: &lt;span id=&quot;endDate&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;script&gt;
        // Configuration
        const TOTAL_DAYS = 548; // 18 months
        const START_DATE = new Date('2026-03-21'); // Starting TODAY!

        // Calculate end date
        const END_DATE = new Date(START_DATE);
        END_DATE.setDate(END_DATE.getDate() + TOTAL_DAYS);

        // Motivational quotes
        const MOTIVATION_QUOTES = [
            &quot;EVERY DAY COUNTS&quot;,
            &quot;PROGRESS OVER PERFECTION&quot;,
            &quot;KEEP MOVING FORWARD&quot;,
            &quot;ONE DAY AT A TIME&quot;,
            &quot;CONSISTENCY IS KEY&quot;,
            &quot;YOU'RE DOING GREAT&quot;,
            &quot;STAY FOCUSED&quot;,
            &quot;SMALL STEPS, BIG WINS&quot;,
            &quot;NEVER GIVE UP&quot;,
            &quot;TRUST THE PROCESS&quot;
        ];

        function formatDate(date) {
            const options = { year: 'numeric', month: 'short', day: 'numeric' };
            return date.toLocaleDateString('en-US', options);
        }

        function calculateDaysCompleted() {
            const today = new Date();
            today.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);
            const start = new Date(START_DATE);
            start.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);

            const diffTime = today - start;
            const diffDays = Math.floor(diffTime / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));

            return Math.max(0, Math.min(diffDays + 1, TOTAL_DAYS));
        }

        function createDots() {
            const container = document.getElementById('dotsContainer');
            const daysCompleted = calculateDaysCompleted();

            for (let i = 0; i &lt; TOTAL_DAYS; i++) {
                const dot = document.createElement('div');
                dot.className = 'dot';

                if (i &lt; daysCompleted - 1) {
                    // Already completed
                    setTimeout(() =&gt; {
                        dot.classList.add('filled');
                    }, i * 5); // Stagger animation
                } else if (i === daysCompleted - 1) {
                    // Today's dot
                    setTimeout(() =&gt; {
                        dot.classList.add('filled', 'today');
                    }, i * 5);
                }

                container.appendChild(dot);
            }
        }

        function updateStats() {
            const daysCompleted = calculateDaysCompleted();
            const percentComplete = Math.round((daysCompleted / TOTAL_DAYS) * 100);
            const daysLeft = TOTAL_DAYS - daysCompleted;

            document.getElementById('daysCompleted').textContent = daysCompleted;
            document.getElementById('percentComplete').textContent = percentComplete + '%';
            document.getElementById('daysLeft').textContent = daysLeft;
            document.getElementById('progressBar').style.width = percentComplete + '%';

            // Update dates
            document.getElementById('startDate').textContent = formatDate(START_DATE);
            document.getElementById('currentDate').textContent = formatDate(new Date());
            document.getElementById('endDate').textContent = formatDate(END_DATE);

            // Random motivation
            const randomQuote = MOTIVATION_QUOTES[Math.floor(Math.random() * MOTIVATION_QUOTES.length)];
            document.getElementById('motivationText').textContent = randomQuote;
        }

        // Initialize
        createDots();
        updateStats();

        // Update every hour
        setInterval(() =&gt; {
            location.reload();
        }, 3600000);
    &lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: ** is new power operator instead of power() in php A: <p>There is a sample ** operator in php 5.6 +</p>
<pre><code>$i = 6;

$i **=2; //output 36

$out = $i ** 3 //output 46656

echo 2 ** 3 ** 2; // 512 (not 64) because this line evaluated right to left  =&gt; 2 ** (3 ** 2)
echo -3 ** 2; // -9 (not 9)
echo 1 - 3 ** 2; // -8
echo ~3 ** 2; // -10 (not 16)
</code></pre>
<p><code>**</code> is better than <code>pow(,)</code> .<br>
When you try to write a math algorithm. <code>**</code> is a Powerful Operator.<br>
there's no functional difference between it and pow.<br>
<a href="https://wiki.php.net/rfc/pow-operator" rel="nofollow noreferrer">power operator refrence</a></p>

Q: How to use a custom function within a class? A: <p>You need to modify your Comment class.
First, you can create an interface for mapping the data it will same as Comment class like. then </p>

<pre><code>export interface IComment {
    _id: any;
    body: any;
    moment: any;
    author: any;
    likes: any;
    dislikes: any;
    parent: any;
    replies: any;
}

export class Comment {

    _id: any;
    body: any;
    moment: any;
    author: any;
    likes: any;
    dislikes: any;
    parent: any;
    replies: any;

    constructor(commentData: IComment) {
       _id: any = commentData._id;
       body: any = commentData.body;
       moment: any = commentData.moment;
       ........
    }


    hello() {
        console.log("hello", this._id + " " + this.body);
    }
}
</code></pre>

<p><strong>comment.component.ts</strong></p>

<pre><code>@Input() comment: IComment; // Using interface for mapping data
commentData: Comment;

    ngOnChanges(){
       if(this.commentData){
         this.commentData = new Comment(this.comment);
         this.commentData.hello();
       }
    }
</code></pre>

<p>If you want to perform any action on the basis of comment class data then write own methods or getter setter for each property for manipulating data like</p>

<pre><code>private _id: string;

  public get id(): string {
    return this.id;
  }
  public set id(value: string) {
    this._id = value;
  }
</code></pre>
